WEBVTT

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:07.130
Good afternoon.

00:00:09.770 --> 00:00:11.800
Wait for me, onee-sama~

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:14.360
Now, it's not lady-like to run.

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:21.660
Th-this place is...

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:24.610
An all girl's school!

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.140
Mika, that kid, what is she thinking!?

00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:30.470
U-um, that person there, who is he?

00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:32.340
Why is a gentleman here?

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.820
W-we should get Sensei...

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:37.490
W-what am I supposed to do...?

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:42.310
If I go into campus like this, I'll definitely be treated like a criminal...

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.850
um...are you...Ayase Yuuto-san?

00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:45.470
huh?

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:46.790
uh...y-yes.

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:53.610
I'm Nogizaka Mika-sans's classmate, Tougazaki Eri.

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:55.160
I'm Hazuse Hikari!

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:56.930
I'm Fujinomiya Miu.

00:00:57.290 --> 00:01:00.100
Okay, we'll take you to our classroom.

00:01:07.070 --> 00:01:11.000
Since Mika talks about you all the time, I was able to recognize you right away.

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:12.180
huh...

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:15.350
What did she say about me, that Mika...?

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:19.530
Mika is waiting for you here.

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:20.410
Go ahead.

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:22.340
Uh, yeah.

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:26.780
Kyaah!!

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:25.050
Yeek!

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:28.190
Everyone, thanks for waiting~

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:31.920
This is the famous onii-san, Ayase Yuuto-san!

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:34.860
Kyaaah!!

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:34.920
Wh-what the...

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:36.510
What's going on...

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:38.850
hehe!

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:13.380
("I'll do you...")

00:03:16.770 --> 00:03:17.790
Excuse me.

00:03:17.820 --> 00:03:18.330
Oh?

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:21.930
Haruka-sama, your change of clothes is here.

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:23.850
Thank you very much.

00:03:24.210 --> 00:03:24.860
Oh,

00:03:25.190 --> 00:03:27.890
would you like to join me today, Hazuki-san?

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:29.020
What...

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:33.200
Ahem.

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:37.410
I'd like to officially present, the real onii-san,

00:03:37.410 --> 00:03:39.700
Ayase Yuuto-san!

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:42.110
Kaaah!!!!

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:48.790
Hey, you better not have invited me here to just show me off...

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:49.880
No way!

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:51.550
I invited you here to brag about you.

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:52.950
What the heck!

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:58.170
Well. That's that, but I actually have something I want to show you.

00:03:58.660 --> 00:03:59.530
What is that?

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:01.350
That's for later, later.

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:02.380
Let me see...

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:05.650
Onii-san is a junior student at Hakujou High School.

00:04:05.830 --> 00:04:07.400
Grades are an okay average.

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:08.750
He's talented in cooking.

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.420
His bloodtype is O.

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:11.760
Favorite color is blue.

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:13.640
His first love was at age 6.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:16.050
The girl was his sister's friend.

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:17.770
Ho-how do you know all these things!?

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:20.600
Why are you guys taking notes!?

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:22.510
Uh, um...

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:25.520
I heard onii-san goes to a co-ed school...

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:26.390
Um...

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:30.400
does that mean...there are a lot of love between two gentlemen........?

00:04:30.430 --> 00:04:31.980
Ho-how daring...

00:04:32.050 --> 00:04:34.630
B-but I'm super curious~

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:36.220
N-no,

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:39.340
I think there are more relationships between boys and girls, like usual...

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:40.930
Uh, um!

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:41.900
Hm?

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:47.040
uh.....m.....

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:49.690
yay...

00:04:50.230 --> 00:04:50.660
Huh!?

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:52.200
Kyaaah!!

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:54.600
I...I touched him!

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:56.200
Th-that's not fair!

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:57.280
L-let me too!

00:04:57.500 --> 00:04:58.420
Waah!!

00:04:58.510 --> 00:05:00.180
H-hold on!

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:02.320
He-hey you guys!

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:04.350
Waaah!!

00:05:04.390 --> 00:05:04.980
Oh!

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:07.090
ugh...ouch...

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:09.040
hm?

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:09.950
heh!?

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:12.070
huh...

00:05:12.530 --> 00:05:13.150
oh...

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:15.840
O-okay, okay, that's enough!

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:17.270
This is it for today!

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:19.910
what~~~~!

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:22.250
H-here, onii-san, let's go!

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:24.360
Oh, he-hey!

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:28.750
Oh...

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:34.320
Gosh geez, everyone's out of control...

00:05:34.670 --> 00:05:36.460
Including you, onii-san!

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:38.070
Just taking pleasure in it!

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:40.010
Th-that's not true!

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:41.740
I wasn't enjoying it at all!

00:05:41.910 --> 00:05:42.960
Is that so?

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:45.480
Maybe I'll tell onee-chan.

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:45.950
ugh...

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:49.800
But, but, it's no wonder everyone would go hyper.

00:05:49.970 --> 00:05:52.280
I mean, they finally met "that" onii-san.

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:55.140
Yup, yup. It's because it's "that" onii-san.

00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:56.740
what do you mean "that"...?

00:05:57.170 --> 00:05:58.940
H-hey you two!

00:05:58.940 --> 00:06:00.640
Stop saying weird stuff!

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:03.440
Huh? It's not weird at all~

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:06.750
You said stuff like you were happy that he petted you on the head~

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:07.280
Wah! Waah waah waaah!!

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:12.120
Also~something like onii-san's lap was warm and cozy~

00:06:10.130 --> 00:06:12.240
Waah waah waaah!!

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:15.470
Uh huh~ I see, that's what it is~

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:17.700
That is what it is~

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:21.000
Wh-wha-what?

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:23.270
Nothing~muhuhu~

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:24.260
uh...

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:26.520
Wh-whatever.

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:32.660
teehee,

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:36.390
it's been a while since I've taken a bath with Hazuki-san.

00:06:36.690 --> 00:06:38.580
We used to take it together all the time before.

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:40.360
How nostalgic...

00:06:40.890 --> 00:06:43.610
Haruka-sama, you've become even more beautiful...

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:46.870
Hazuki-san too, you're very beautiful.

00:06:47.310 --> 00:06:48.600
...that can't be...

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:51.850
Hazuki-san, should I wash your back?

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:52.680
huh...?

00:06:52.980 --> 00:06:55.770
Here, hurry, hurry.

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:02.960
Oh, hello.

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:04.040
Mika-senpai!

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:06.770
Senpai, are you going to after-school club as well?

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:08.510
Yeah, kind of.

00:07:08.970 --> 00:07:09.850
See ya~

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.170
What's wrong?

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:14.220
No...

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:17.610
It just feels weird hearing them call Mika: "Senpai".

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:18.240
President-Mika!

00:07:18.690 --> 00:07:19.820
Hm? What's up?

00:07:20.190 --> 00:07:22.290
It's about next year's budget.

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:24.350
Also, please look through this...

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:25.270
Let's see...

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:29.410
What president...?

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:32.720
Oh, Mika is the school president!

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:33.580
Huh!?!?

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:38.360
And, for the first time in school history, she's been elected twice in a row since freshman year.

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:42.640
If all goes well, it's said that she's going to win the third time too for sure.

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:44.520
I-is that so...

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:49.440
Mika is liked by everyone, regardless of grades, and the teachers trust her too.

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:54.550
There's even a fan club, called, "Moonlight Strawberry".

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:57.450
(Moonlight Strawberry)

00:07:57.030 --> 00:07:59.200
(Usually)

00:07:59.720 --> 00:08:01.090
hmmm...

00:08:01.530 --> 00:08:02.370
hmm?

00:08:02.610 --> 00:08:04.650
You're having some rude thoughts, aren't you?

00:08:05.140 --> 00:08:07.220
N-no, no way!

00:08:07.510 --> 00:08:08.830
Really?

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:11.630
Tada!

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:16.450
This is our Modern Theater Arts Culture Research Club's clubroom.

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:22.170
What is...Modern Theater...?

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:28.110
Specifically speaking, we go to theaters to see performing arts and plays, and also act ourselves too.

00:08:28.530 --> 00:08:30.610
Isn't that just a Drama Club?

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:32.510
That's completely different.

00:08:32.600 --> 00:08:35.670
Drama Club is Drama Club, and our club is our club, geez.

00:08:35.710 --> 00:08:36.670
huh...

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:44.900
...so, what's the thing that you want to show me?

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:47.740
Oh, well you see~

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:52.670
So, so, does Ayase-onii-san have a girlfriend?

00:08:52.870 --> 00:08:53.260
huh!?

00:08:54.110 --> 00:08:56.090
I said, a girlfriend!

00:08:56.390 --> 00:08:59.790
I heard that 80% of co-ed people are couples.

00:08:59.950 --> 00:09:02.590
That is definitely an urban legend...

00:09:02.670 --> 00:09:03.900
wow...

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:08.740
so then onii-san is what society calls a useless-guy, huh?

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:09.350
huh?

00:09:09.470 --> 00:09:11.300
What, really?

00:09:11.510 --> 00:09:14.060
Onii-san is a useless-guy?

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:19.010
Well, if you say onii-san, it means useless, and useless means onii-san, so...

00:09:19.310 --> 00:09:20.150
ugh...

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:23.840
Y-you don't have to say it like that...

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:25.630
Even if he was useless,

00:09:25.740 --> 00:09:32.090
Ayase-san must have Ayase-san's own good qualities, so you probably shouldn't say that he's useless that much...

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:33.690
aw...

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:35.660
O-oh?

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:37.950
Eri-chan, you've gone for the kill...

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:41.150
Onii-san, please cheer up~

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:41.890
oh...

00:09:42.340 --> 00:09:45.280
teehee, I've heard all about it from Mika~

00:09:45.280 --> 00:09:48.360
that Onii-san's lap is the best to sit on.

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:49.690
Right, Miu?

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:50.730
Yes.

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:52.730
Then now Miu too~

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:53.330
uh...

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:58.350
H-hey you two!

00:09:58.870 --> 00:10:01.050
Why not? Just a little bit.

00:10:01.050 --> 00:10:03.920
It's not fair for Mika to hog it all to yourself!

00:10:03.920 --> 00:10:07.070
Aww, it really feels good to sit here.

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:08.710
How about you, Eri-chan?

00:10:08.990 --> 00:10:11.550
Huh? A-are you talking to me?

00:10:12.050 --> 00:10:13.500
There's still lots of room~

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:15.050
uh, um...

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:17.440
Then excuse me for a little bit...

00:10:17.820 --> 00:10:18.780
Hmm.

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:21.450
E-Eri-chan, you too...?

00:10:22.590 --> 00:10:26.910
Onii-san, please come visit us again.

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:30.330
This feeling's grown on me already~

00:10:30.780 --> 00:10:33.060
Miu would want you to come again too~

00:10:33.450 --> 00:10:36.290
Uh, um, if it's not too much trouble...

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:38.890
I c-can't really...

00:10:39.050 --> 00:10:40.120
uuuh...

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:43.120
n-no no no noooooo!!

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:49.160
This! Is Mika's reserved seat!

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:49.750
So...!

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:50.390
Huh!?

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:51.890
huh....

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:51.450
uhuhu...

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:54.810
teeheehee...

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:58.560
Oh! Um, so uh....um...

00:10:59.240 --> 00:10:59.840
hm?

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:01.590
A-anyways!

00:11:02.230 --> 00:11:03.590
Onii-san, here!

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:05.210
What is this?

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:07.220
Today's real subject.

00:11:09.570 --> 00:11:11.800
I invited you here to show you this!

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:11.900
("Sweet Mika-chan")

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:14.860
(Script: Mika Nogizaka)

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:19.820
(Useless)

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:17.960
U...useless...

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:24.910
(Onii-san)

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:22.340
Cheer up...

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:23.570
Onii-san!

00:11:28.010 --> 00:11:30.880
Ooh...I'm getting kind of nervous!

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:32.870
Would we be able to do this right...?

00:11:33.310 --> 00:11:36.200
It's okay! We just have to do it like we do all the time!

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:37.250
Let's do this!

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:38.500
Yeah!

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:38.500
Yeah!

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:38.500
Yeah!

00:11:39.320 --> 00:11:41.500
Magical, cynical, miracle~!

00:11:41.670 --> 00:11:44.370
Sweet Mika-chan has now arrived!

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:46.770
Aww, Sweet Mika-chan!

00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:48.770
It's Sweet Mika-chan!

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:52.140
Man! You're already here? Mika-chan!?

00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:55.580
Now that I'm here, I won't let you get your way!

00:11:55.920 --> 00:11:56.760
Huhu...

00:11:57.260 --> 00:11:58.950
You think that's possible?

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:01.110
Luladah-forore!

00:12:01.290 --> 00:12:02.340
Huhuhu...

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:06.230
that won't even affect me in any way.

00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:21.970
Oh...

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:27.890
I love you!

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:32.630
Don't go!

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:34.230
Don't go, Mika!

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:36.570
I...I need you...!

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:46.880
Teeheehee~how was it?

00:12:46.880 --> 00:12:48.520
That's our brand new play.

00:12:48.840 --> 00:12:52.350
I don't know about the technical stuff, but it was pretty good.

00:12:52.510 --> 00:12:53.420
I enjoyed it.

00:12:53.780 --> 00:12:54.810
Really.

00:12:55.150 --> 00:12:59.250
I wanted to get an objective review before the actual performance.

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:01.280
Thanks, onii-san.

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:02.700
Uh...um...

00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:05.120
how was my acting?

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:05.750
Hm?

00:13:05.990 --> 00:13:07.370
I thought it was good.

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:12.070
I...can't really understand the main boy character's feeling very well...

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:16.020
I'm not sure if parting with a girl you fell in love with is quite like that...

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:19.440
In that kind of situation, how do boys feel?

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:21.980
Eri-chan is so earnest.

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:25.140
Her acting is always so well thought out.

00:13:25.370 --> 00:13:27.720
Onii-san, please help her out.

00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:29.380
Hmm...

00:13:29.770 --> 00:13:32.820
it's kind of hard to explain in words...

00:13:33.170 --> 00:13:34.860
how can I say...

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:38.090
Then let's have him do a sample act for us!

00:13:38.090 --> 00:13:39.390
That's a good idea!

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:40.790
Miu agrees too!

00:13:40.980 --> 00:13:44.740
Wh-what are you guys saying? I can't act at all!

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:46.130
I can't be an example!

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:48.580
You won't...do it...?

00:13:49.620 --> 00:13:50.150
Uh...

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:52.000
O-okay.

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:54.130
I'll give it a try, at least.

00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:55.560
Really!?

00:13:55.860 --> 00:13:57.860
Th-thank you very much!

00:13:58.140 --> 00:14:02.070
Aww, you're always so nice to girls~

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:06.910
Uh...how can I say no to someone so sincere?

00:14:07.190 --> 00:14:10.330
But can we at least have someone else be my partner?

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:13.450
What!? I'm not good enough for you!?

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:17.220
No...I've a feeling if I do it with Mika, I'll start laughing...

00:14:17.220 --> 00:14:18.590
What did you say!?

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:19.400
Huh!?

00:14:19.020 --> 00:14:20.470
Wah!

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:21.280
Fine then!

00:14:21.510 --> 00:14:23.350
Then, Eri-chan, can you do it for him?

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:26.600
It's probably better if you see it up close for your reference.

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:28.240
Oh, yes.

00:14:28.810 --> 00:14:30.320
Okay, let's begin.

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:33.490
Onii-san, are you ready?

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:38.340
W-wait, Mika!

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:40.240
Onii-chan...

00:14:40.390 --> 00:14:44.020
Th-that's not fair...leaving without saying anything.

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:46.020
How could you do that to me!?

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:47.180
But...

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:50.610
If I see you, I know I won't be able to leave...

00:14:51.130 --> 00:14:53.160
I finally realized that...

00:14:53.800 --> 00:14:55.850
the person who I really love is...

00:14:56.380 --> 00:14:58.440
I've always needed Mika!

00:14:59.080 --> 00:14:59.840
Oh...

00:15:00.270 --> 00:15:01.710
And...next is...

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:03.160
Huh!?

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:05.050
(Draw Mika closer, gently. Look into each other's eyes and exchange a kiss.)

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:06.600
Uh...

00:15:06.890 --> 00:15:10.660
Th-that's right! Wh-wh-wh-what should I do!?

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:14.000
Uh, Onii-san, for this scene, uh...

00:15:16.030 --> 00:15:16.420
Oh...

00:15:22.160 --> 00:15:23.320
Huh!?

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:25.530
Mika!

00:15:25.750 --> 00:15:27.770
W-wait, onii-san!

00:15:28.850 --> 00:15:29.650
Mika!

00:15:29.920 --> 00:15:33.040
N-n-n-no, stop, onii-san! You can't!

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:35.230
I haven't even done it!

00:15:35.790 --> 00:15:36.480
Mika...

00:15:38.860 --> 00:15:40.130
Onii-san!!!!

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:42.030
Oh...

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:42.640
Hm?

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:43.630
What can it be?

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:45.820
Class President, Nogizaka Mika-san,

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:47.820
the Vice Principal would like to see you.

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:47.550
Ooh...

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:47.820
Hm...

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:50.040
Please come to the office immediately.

00:15:50.490 --> 00:15:54.530
Oh, th-that's me. Wh-what do they want? Uh, I'll be right back,

00:15:54.690 --> 00:15:55.870
Uh, yeah...

00:15:57.190 --> 00:15:59.270
Wh-what the heck, onii-san!

00:15:59.630 --> 00:16:01.790
What are you doing?  Geez!

00:16:05.840 --> 00:16:08.480
Aw. That was a nice bath.

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:11.160
Hazuki-san, do you have any plans after this?

00:16:11.710 --> 00:16:13.630
I'm going to go shopping for dinner.

00:16:13.890 --> 00:16:16.150
Also, I must take Nelson-kun on a walk.

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:17.820
Nelson-kun?

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:19.870
Yes. This is Nelson-kun.

00:16:20.180 --> 00:16:21.480
Wow. He's so cute!

00:16:23.780 --> 00:16:29.450
It's time to leave school campus. Those students still on campus, go home right away.

00:16:30.180 --> 00:16:34.180
Sorry everyone, the Vice Principal's talk was long...

00:16:34.460 --> 00:16:34.850
Hm?

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:37.750
Where's everyone?

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:41.020
They said they had stuff to do and went home.

00:16:41.320 --> 00:16:42.620
Here, they said this was for you.

00:16:43.150 --> 00:16:43.800
Uh...

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:48.480
(Have fun locking up and stuff with Ayase onii-san, thanks.)

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:51.120
G-geez,

00:16:51.250 --> 00:16:53.490
they should mind their own business!

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:54.980
Hm? What was it?

00:16:55.100 --> 00:16:58.260
N-nothing whatsoever! Here, let's clean up, hurry!

00:16:58.260 --> 00:16:59.910
Uh...yeah...

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:08.610
We're finally done, huh?

00:17:09.180 --> 00:17:11.130
I'm sorry to make you work so much.

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:12.360
Let's go home, quick!

00:17:12.830 --> 00:17:14.690
Is someone still here!?

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:17.120
Oh no! Onii-san, hide, now!

00:17:17.190 --> 00:17:17.790
Huh!?

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:19.790
Who is it!? ...hm?

00:17:22.910 --> 00:17:26.110
H-hey, onii-san, you just stepped on my foot!

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:28.970
B-but I can't help it!

00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:31.980
Ah! Don't touch me there!

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.330
Th-that was an accident!

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:38.490
Oh...there's something hard rubbing against my stomach...

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:40.810
O-onii-san, are you...?

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:44.770
Th-that's my belt! It's nothing weird!

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:47.370
Weird...? It's not a cell phone?

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:49.920
Oh...uh...no...

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:51.350
Hm?

00:17:51.600 --> 00:17:53.160
I thought I heard something...

00:17:56.530 --> 00:17:57.210
Phew.

00:17:57.320 --> 00:17:59.130
We barely made that one.

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:01.170
Ah!

00:18:01.790 --> 00:18:05.690
It's no time for relief! Sensei locked us in from outside!

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:06.550
What!?

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:14.930
This isn't good...it's the 4th floor here, so we can't get out from the window...

00:18:15.040 --> 00:18:17.200
Then, let's call someone with a cell phone...

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:19.740
oops, no reception...

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:22.320
Geez, how useless!

00:18:22.820 --> 00:18:24.320
How about Mika's cell phone?

00:18:24.550 --> 00:18:27.060
I left it in my classroom, along with my bag...

00:18:27.530 --> 00:18:30.160
Man...what should we do now...?

00:18:31.030 --> 00:18:32.870
Well, it'll be okay, somehow.

00:18:33.260 --> 00:18:33.780
Huh?

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:36.310
Worst case, we can just knock down the door.

00:18:36.490 --> 00:18:37.660
Don't worry about it. Okay?

00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:39.410
Onii-san,

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:41.020
you're so calm...

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:43.270
you seem so grown-up right now.

00:18:43.650 --> 00:18:44.900
Oh...really?

00:18:45.280 --> 00:18:46.470
Yeah, really.

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:54.150
Even the acting earlier, too, I was super nervous, but onii-san seemed just fine doing that kind of thing...

00:18:54.260 --> 00:18:56.310
Th-that's not true!

00:18:56.470 --> 00:18:59.000
I was super nervous too!

00:18:59.560 --> 00:19:01.660
It didn't look like that at all!

00:19:02.630 --> 00:19:04.410
Also, even now,

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:09.290
you're all alone with someone this cute, but still really calm...

00:19:09.590 --> 00:19:11.650
I...I don't know what to say...?

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:14.800
Here, here! Isn't your heart racing?

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:19.530
You're all alone on campus with an innocent, frail, beautiful girl at night~

00:19:19.610 --> 00:19:22.220
Who's innocent and frail...?

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:25.480
Mmm! Then how about this?

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:33.180
Then what about this?

00:19:37.180 --> 00:19:38.450
...that's enough...

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:40.770
Th-this is a disgrace!

00:19:40.770 --> 00:19:43.000
F-fine then, this is my last resort!

00:19:43.400 --> 00:19:45.400
Wah! What are you doing!?

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:49.250
Onee-sama!

00:19:50.630 --> 00:19:52.580
I sense that there's something wrong...

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:54.920
Maybe...

00:19:55.850 --> 00:19:58.530
Haruna-sama! What's going to happen??

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:01.660
M-Mika...what are you...?

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:06.950
O-onii-san won't notice me no matter what I do, so this is my last resort...

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:12.440
M-Mother said so too...to just push them over at times like this...

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:15.330
Akiho-san...how could you...

00:20:16.340 --> 00:20:19.060
H-how about now? Are you nervous?

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:19.820
Eh?

00:20:20.230 --> 00:20:24.300
I...I'm this nervous and pushing my limits...

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:29.470
it's not fair for onii-san to not feel anything.

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:30.120
Uh...

00:20:30.980 --> 00:20:32.010
So...

00:20:32.920 --> 00:20:34.630
s-so...

00:20:34.890 --> 00:20:37.710
I decided to make onii-san nervous too...

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:44.990
either you're awake or asleep, I'll fill onii-san up with thoughts of me so you can't forget me...

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:49.230
I'll make you all Mi-Mikka-Mika...

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:52.080
Uh...um...

00:20:53.030 --> 00:20:54.160
Oni...

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:58.560
Yuuto...sa...

00:20:58.160 --> 00:20:59.510
Well...

00:20:59.810 --> 00:21:02.750
I'm very sorry to interrupt, but...

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:03.910
Ah!

00:21:04.570 --> 00:21:05.340
Uh...

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:09.470
Wh-why are you here!?

00:21:09.820 --> 00:21:14.410
Yes, since Mika-sama wasn't home at dinner time,

00:21:14.490 --> 00:21:16.340
I came to make sure things were okay.

00:21:16.530 --> 00:21:19.990
I was just walking Nelson-kun after some grocery shopping.

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:21.440
Uh...

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:21.440
Um...

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:26.230
Um~did we, just maybe, get in your way?

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:28.090
Uh, ah, ah...

00:21:28.400 --> 00:21:33.440
In that case, please just ignore us and continue~

00:21:33.610 --> 00:21:37.990
As Mika-sama wishes, let him become Mikka-Mika.

00:21:38.160 --> 00:21:38.990
koku koku

00:21:39.700 --> 00:21:40.520
ni...

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:41.700
ni...

00:21:42.410 --> 00:21:46.690
niyaaaaah!!

00:21:47.990 --> 00:21:50.710
Geez! Forget you, Nanami-san!

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:56.010
Aww, I'm sorry. I did knock just in case.

00:21:56.220 --> 00:21:59.120
Mika-sama was just overwhelmed with Mikka-Mika, so...

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:00.000
koku koku

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:01.210
Migyaah!!

00:22:01.470 --> 00:22:04.930
Don't be so angry. They came to help us.

00:22:04.980 --> 00:22:07.670
Geez, just because it's not about you!

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:12.730
Okay then, onii-san, as a punishment for  embarrassing a girl, carry me home!

00:22:12.830 --> 00:22:13.370
Huh!?

00:22:13.520 --> 00:22:15.020
Here, here, hurry up!

00:22:15.200 --> 00:22:16.690
Geez...

00:22:17.270 --> 00:22:18.180
here!

00:22:20.630 --> 00:22:23.600
Heeheehee! Princess style!

00:22:24.170 --> 00:22:25.120
Dah...

00:22:28.240 --> 00:22:31.640
I haven't given up yet...

00:22:31.930 --> 00:22:32.610
Huh?

00:22:33.040 --> 00:22:37.140
Someday for sure, with my super and great charm,

00:22:37.230 --> 00:22:39.930
I'll make you Mikka-Mika, inside and out!

00:22:40.600 --> 00:22:43.190
Be ready for that, onii-san!

00:24:14.800 --> 00:24:19.310
(Nogizaka Vocabulary Fundamentals)

00:24:16.110 --> 00:24:18.840
Nogizaka Vocabulary Fundamentals!

00:24:18.910 --> 00:24:20.080
This week, it's "date"!

00:24:19.310 --> 00:24:30.610
(date)

00:24:20.140 --> 00:24:26.160
It's where a man and a woman touches each other and cultivate love!

00:24:26.160 --> 00:24:27.920
So Yuuto's finally gonna become a man, huh?

00:24:27.840 --> 00:24:31.310
And Haruka-chan will become a woman! Ahh!

00:24:30.590 --> 00:24:33.640
Alright! Let's have a toast tonight!! We'll drink till dawn!

00:24:30.610 --> 00:24:34.820
(Next: "It's My First Time")

00:24:33.450 --> 00:24:34.820
I wish you happiness!

00:24:34.820 --> 00:24:40.400
(See you next week!)

00:24:34.820 --> 00:24:40.400
(Nogizaka Haruka no Himitsu Purezza)
